Atomically rename a live todo across workflow-owned surfaces

Usage: telec-cli workflow todo rename [OPTIONS] <OLD_SLUG> <NEW_SLUG>

Arguments:
  <OLD_SLUG>  Current todo slug
  <NEW_SLUG>  New todo slug

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>  Override the project context. By default the project name is derived from the current working directory's basename
  -h, --help               Print help
